export anchor BorderColor:
    description:
        Sets the colour of the component's borders. One value sets all sides; two set top/bottom then left/right; three set top, left/right, bottom; four set top, right, bottom, left.

    identifier: borderColor

    cssProperty:
        Corresponds to the CSS `border-color` property.

    values:
        - `<color>`
        - `<top> <right>? <bottom>? <left>?`

    initial: #000000

    appliesTo: All components.

    example:
        ```emul
        \\\
        component Example:
            borderColor: #3b82f6
        \\\
        ```
